# Used by `npm run build` (Vercel runs it). Public values only: these end up in the browser bundle.
# "/api" = through the site's own address; vercel.json forwards /api/* to https://collab-api-ewju.onrender.com.
# That way sign-in doesn't depend on the backend's CORS list. Live updates (WebSocket) still go to the backend directly.
